  "name": "cloud-logging-finops",
  "description": "Audits Cloud Logging costs for a Google Cloud project: the charges for log entries written to log buckets, the services, log streams and severities that drive them, and the log sinks that route them. Reconciles Cloud Billing export costs with Cloud Monitoring volume metrics, and generates a FinOps report with charts and copy-paste exclusion filters. Use when auditing Cloud Logging spend, finding logging waste, identifying top logging contributors, generating log cost reduction reports, or creating log sink exclusion filters. Don't use for querying log entries (use cloud-logging-query-generation), configuring Cloud Monitoring alerts, or querying metrics/traces.",
